<title>UK: LIFFE Jan certified coffee stocks up at 2,831 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE Jan certified coffee stocks up at 2,831 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rose to 2,831 five-tonne lots in January from 1,875 in December, the exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks held in LIFFE-nominated warehouses as at January 31 (in five-tonne lots):</p>
<p>    Ports		    January	December</p>
<p>    UK				2	     2</p>
<p>    Rotterdam		   145	    23</p>
<p>    Amsterdam		   nil	   nil</p>
<p>    Hamburg		     138	   118</p>
<p>    Bremen			134	   119</p>
<p>    Antwerp		   1,640	   881</p>
<p>    Le Harve		    306	   345</p>
<p>    Barcelona		   247	    44</p>
<p>    Trieste			 8	     9</p>
<p>    New York		     30	   107</p>
<p>    New Orleans		 181	   227</p>
<p>    Total		     2,831	 1,875</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
</text>
